================================================================
              README for klitcl version 1.00
================================================================

1. Contents of package

 This archive containing follow files.

  README           (README file written in Japanese)
  Makefile         (Makefile for generate klitcld)
  klitcld.c        (Source file of klitcld)
  klitcl.kl1       (klitcl module written by klic)

  ---in `doc' directory

   klitcl.doc      (Usage of klitcl (written in Japanese))

   klitcl.tex      (Users Manual (written in Japanese))
   klitcl.eps      (Figure for Manual)
   sample1.eps     (as above)
   sample2.eps     (as above)

   catalog_page.tex (Introduction of klitcl
                       (IFS catalog form written in Japanese))

  ---in `sample' directory

   sample1.kl1     (sample file)
   sample2.kl1     (sample file)

  ---in `hanoi' directory

   readme          (Explanation of sample application)
   hanoi.tcl       (Sample application (`The tower of hanoi' Tcl part))
   hanoi.kl1       (Sample application (`The tower of hanoi' klic part))

2. How to Install and Use klitcl

   2.1 Generate klitcld

     In extracted directory, type `make'.
     (If you need, edit Makefile)

   2.2 Compile a application program

     Application program using klitcl module must be
     compiled with klitcl.kl1.

     For example....

     % klic -o prog klitcl.kl1 prog.kl1

   2.3 Execute a application

     In the first, execute `klitcld'.

     Next, execute your application program.

     For Example....

     % ./klitcld &
     % ./prog

     <NOTICE> 
        klitcld and your application must be executed in
        _same_directory_.

3. Target of this program

   Target user of this program is......

    * User who want to attach GUI to application made by klic.
    * User who want to use klic predicate in Tcl/Tk script.

